 display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\" style=\"margin-left: 0.647em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 1.499em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">\u222b</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This integral gives the signed area between the curve and the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"96\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155717-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155717-e-0\"></div>\n\n\n<p>Note that the graph above consists of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"97\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> parts:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"98\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c 